# Removing the targeted flyer in response makes the ability fail to resolve (CR 608.2b).
# A later activation against a legal flyer resolves normally.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Grapeshot Catapult
Ornithopter
Memnite
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Unsummon
Ornithopter
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grapeshot Catapult.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
